Social Champ materials (not covered by the MIT licence above)

Owner: Social Champ. Published here by Sameer Ahmed Khan, Social Champ's co-founder and CEO, on Social Champ's behalf.

Covered files: scripts/engine/assets/ (the Social Champ name, logo and wordmark, and the screen captures in
scripts/engine/assets/screens/), scripts/engine/switch.js and scripts/engine/man.js in full (the Switch mascot and
the Leo character as designed and modelled), and the example reel and its audio and data (media/, examples/).

You may download, clone or fork this repository with these files in it, and render the example on your own machine
to learn how the kit works. You may not use the Social Champ name or logo, the Switch mascot, the Leo character or the
screen captures in your own videos or products, redistribute them outside copies of this repository, or use any of
them commercially. All other rights are reserved.

The screen captures are first-party Social Champ marketing images (as published on Social Champ's own site); they
contain no personal data. In brand.png the stock photo of the demo post has been replaced with a plain fill, so
no third-party photograph is redistributed here; the example reel shows the original only blurred on a background
monitor, as part of Social Champ's own marketing image. The example audio was generated with elevenlabs.io on ElevenLabs' free plan, which has no
commercial licence: it is included for demonstration only and may not be reused.
